<title>USA: UPS, Teamsters arrive to restart contract talks.</title>
<headline>UPS, Teamsters arrive to restart contract talks.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Parcel Service officials and representatives  of the Teamsters union arrived for talks on Friday to try to negotiate  new contract terms and avert a strike.</p>
<p>Negotiators from both sides walked into the Federal Mediation and  Conciliation Service in Washington at 1:15 p.m. EDT (1715 GMT).</p>
</text>
